WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Now it is time for everyone to get hands-on

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.640
and start building that muscle memory.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.120
Please head over to your mannequins in your small groups.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.400
For this exercise, we want no more

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.440
than three students per mannequin

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.080
to make sure everyone gets plenty of time to practice.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.000
Our goal for this session is simple but vital.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.680
Focus on consistency and rhythm.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.299
Remember, chest compressions are the most important action

00:00:26.299 --> 00:00:29.059
you can take for someone in cardiac arrest.

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:31.459
We are looking for four key things.

00:00:31.459 --> 00:00:34.259
Correct hand placement centered on the sternum,

00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:36.820
pushing to a depth of at least two inches,

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.500
maintaining a rate of 100 to 120 beats per minute,

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.639
and allowing that chest to fully recoil every single time.

00:00:44.639 --> 00:00:47.459
While you work, your instructor will play a steady beat

00:00:47.459 --> 00:00:49.060
to help you keep the right pace

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.740
and give each of you enough time

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:54.259
to perform three full sets of 30 compressions.

00:00:54.259 --> 00:00:57.540
As you do your compressions, please count out loud.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.580
It really helps you stay focused

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.459
and prevents you from losing track

00:01:01.459 --> 00:01:03.220
in the heat of the moment.

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:05.320
Your instructor will be moving around the room

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.820
to offer feedback.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.900
Go ahead and start your sets now.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:11.180
Push to the beat, use your shoulders,

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.699
and let that chest expand fully between every push.

00:01:14.699 --> 00:01:16.300
♪ Do the CPR ♪

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.900
♪ Pump, pump, pump, pump ♪

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.540
♪ Do the CPR ♪

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.180
♪ Hero of the night and day ♪

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:28.379
